  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Scaling laws: balance model size and data",
    "description": "Loss follows power laws in model parameters N, data D, and compute. Under C\u22486ND, Chinchilla found compute-optimal training scales N and D together at about D\u224820N. Thresholded evaluation metrics can make smooth capability gains look like sudden emergence."
  }
